[[[[138.48052445496805, 285.3325845732578, "Members’ Attendance in the House of Assembly  "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 528.8341419945134, "Section 13 of the House of Assembly Accountability, Integrity and Administration Act requires that a Member "]], [[0.0002794650881909888, 538.3142528089804, "(excluding the Premier, the Leader of the Official Opposition and the Leader of a Third Party) attend the House "]], [[0.0002794650881909888, 463.52076270601674, "of Assembly when it is sitting, but outlines acceptable reasons for a Member’s absence, such as: "]], [[18.000226561106473, 156.5944427552636, "•    sickness of the Member; "]], [[18.00028644648254, 352.43416213534306, "•    adoption, pregnancy or parental leave as established by directive; "]], [[17.99974747809813, 269.4798567286264, "•    a serious illness related to the Member’s family; "]], [[17.99980736347414, 103.55405385775092, "•    bereavement; "]], [[17.99986724885015, 527.5143655243825, "•    attendance at a meeting of a committee of the House of Assembly, the Commission or a committee of "]], [[35.99987423024456, 120.83409676658775, "the Commission; "]], [[17.99992713422627, 515.754186431934, "•    attendance to duties as a Member of a caucus, attendance to constituency business, or attendance to "]], [[35.99993411562056, 145.67413520577782, "ministerial duties; and "]], [[17.999987019602273, 272.514161611624, "•    other circumstances as approved by the Speaker. "]], [[0.0, 534.5941049397604, "By January 31 of each year, a Member is required to file with the Clerk a declaration under oath or affirmation "]], [[0.0, 525.4738641539608, "of his or her attendance while the House of Assembly was sitting in the previous year. Dates of any absences "]], [[0.0, 531.834699931051, "and an explanation for those absences must be provided.  A deduction in the amount of $200 is made from the "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 518.3952688606694, "Member’s salary for each day the Member was absent from a sitting of the House of Assembly for a reason "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 228.23510391689658, "other than those provided for in the legislation. "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 535.7952618743068, "In accordance with the House of Assembly Publication Scheme, the following table provides a summary of the "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 534.1146965302296, "attendance of all Members of the House of Assembly, including those who resigned or were elected during the "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 509.8750706398897, "reporting period January 1 to December 31, 2010. The House of Assembly had 51 sitting days during this "]], [[0.0009980896006211992, 36.59525748544374, "period. "]], [[46.56097968460058, 496.4357181111749, "Summary of Members’ Attendance for the Period January 1, 2010 - December 31, 2010 "]], [[47.40107170156358, 424.6758293378492, "Member                                             District                                  Approved "], [470.6410667144976, 504.2352979996865, "Other "]], [[372.36108009750797, 422.6353244182211, "Absences "], [462.3610750808956, 512.6352904170867, "Absences "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 491.9937050522426, "Baker, Jim                                Labrador West                                                         0                            0 "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 490.9998427641659, "Buckingham, Ed                      St. John’s East                                                         1                            0 "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 70.55433033150999, "Brazil, David  "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 493.319900182815, "(elected Dec. 2010)                            Conception Bay East – Bell Island                        n/a                         n/a "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 488.0059233451349, "Burke, Joan                              St. George’s – Stephenville East                             0                            0 "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 491.99362328475, "Butler, Roland                          Port d